<overview>
<p>Com Guard conventional infantry benefit from ComStar's access to preserved Star League technology, fielding weapons and equipment that match or exceed the standard issue of any Inner Sphere military, backed by the institutional discipline of the secular Order's professional military culture. Manning heavy ultra autocannon capable of rapid double-fire bursts, these gun crews can deliver devastating concentrated firepower that threatens medium armor, though the punishing rate of fire demands careful barrel management.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Squad/platoon size from TechManual. Armor kit from Tactical Operations. Intro date from official creation of ComStar Guards and Militia (ComGuards).
